    .startObject()
        .array("dynamic_date_formats", "yyyy-MM-dd", "yyyy/MM/dd", "dd-MM-yyyy")
        .array("dynamic_templates", "template1", "template2")
        .field("date_detection", true)
        .field("numeric_detection", true)
    .endObject();

String builderStr = builder.toString();
String paramsStr = "[\"include_defaults\",true,\"skip_runtime_fields\",true]";

functions.RootObjectMapper_doXContent(
    new RootObjectMapperDoXContentParams(builderStr, paramsStr)
);
```

That’s all you need to generate the XContent for a `RootObjectMapper` with the requested defaults while skipping runtime fields. Happy coding!

